9,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_159","Besides, you're sharp. As soon as I mentioned a gift \"in return,\" you must've realized exactly what I wanted...==W== Right?",9,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_159","Who says a gift has to be tangible? The memories we make on the road are just as precious. Don't you agree?",9,""],["w",0.5],["choice",["I guess I see your point..."],[[]]],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,null,400.0,null,"Linear",8.0,null,null,null],["say","avg1_159","Then it's simple.==W== The gift I want is memories of us spending time together.",9,""],["w",1.5],["goon"],["w",1.5],["say","avg1_159","We've made plenty of memories since arriving here, sure. But sadly, I've always been a rather greedy person.",9,""],["w",1.5],["say","avg1_159","After all, you can never have too many memories, can you? Especially for a Trekker.",9,""],["w",1.5],["say","avg1_159","It's a pity we can't control which memories pay for our wishes... The thought of the Monolith devouring my time with you is ... rather unpleasant.",9,""],["w",1.5],["choice",["I get that, but..."],[[]]],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,300.0,-300.0,null,"OutQuad",1.2,null,null,null],["w",1.2],["choice",["Isn't this specific memory a little ... scary?"],[[]]],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_159","Hm? What are you staring at...?==W== Oh! This? You mean the syringe?",9,""],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_159","a","002",0.23,-0.3,null,0,"attention",0.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_159","I'm not going to use it on you; it's just for atmosphere.",9,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_159","Ah...==W== Just imagining the face you'll make, the sounds you'll let slip...==W== It's getting me all worked up...!",9,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Xiao"],["choice",["Coronis! Get a grip!"],[[]]],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",15.0,null,null,null],["say","avg1_159","Don't be scared. A doctor's gotta be gentle with her patients, right?",9,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_159","... Ah, wait. What we are again... Doctor and assistant? No... Surely something far more intimate...",9,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_159","Hehe...==W== You know you're special to me, don't you? I wouldn't do anything ... naughty.",9,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["choice",["You're definitely plotting something twisted!!"],[[]]],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_159","Hehe, always so guarded...==W== Come now, relax. Focus on my voice ... and surrender your body and mind to me.",9,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_159","Making new memories together, far from home...==W== Mmm,==W== now that is the perfect souvenir!",9,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["goon"],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.75],["w",0.75],["bg","phoenix_hostel_room_night",0,0.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.75],["w",1.25],["show","avg1_159","a","002",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_159","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",1.0],["bgm","m57"],["ctl","avg1_159","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_159","So...==W== How's it feel?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_159","a","002","question",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","011",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Ahh...==W== My body feels ... weightless. Incredible.==W== You've got magic hands, Coronis.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","011","flower","xiangjiao"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","013",null,null],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","020",null,"lengzhan"],["say","avg3_100","Makes my clumsy attempt earlier look downright embarrassing...",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_159","a","012","happy",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_159","Just your first time, that's all! Besides, your technique wasn't half bad.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","010",null,"lengzhan"],["say","avg3_100","Glad to hear it...==W== But I'm the o